# [LSR](../wg/lsr.html)

## Summary

The Link State Routing (LSR) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session was chaired by Yingzhen Qu and Acee Lindem (remote). The working group reviewed working group document status and discussed multiple technical proposals spanning OSPF and IS-IS protocol enhancements, performance optimizations, flooding improvements, capability signaling, and metric normalization.

